spectrometer Nicolet iS50<\/a> and <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/product\/dxr3xi-microscope\/\">Raman microscope DXR3xi<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>Examples of applications of molecular spectroscopy in &#8220;high-end&#8221; scientific research:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/carbon-nano-applications\/\">Carbon nanoapplications<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/immunotherapy-research-using-raman-spectroscopy\/\">Immunotherapy research using Raman spectroscopy<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/determination-of-hydrogen-concentration-in-silicon-nitride-films-on-silicon-wafers\/\">Determination of hydrogen concentration in silicon nitride films on silicon wafers<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/gas-analysis\/\">Quantitative analysis of gases (from ppt concentration) including resolution of different isotopes<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/protein-analysis\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Protein analysis<\/a><\/li>\n<li>Photoacoustic PA-FTIR, PM-IRRAS, VLD, VCD, ROA, SPRS, STRS, SRS, 2D-IR etc.<\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/security-forces\/analysis-of-inks-using-imaging-ft-ir-atr\/\">Analysis of inks using imaging FT-IR ATR<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/characterization-of-amorphous-and-crystalline-silicon\/\">Characterization of amorphous and crystalline silicon<\/a><\/li>\n<li>Rheo-optical studies of polymers: <a href=\"http:\/\/www.appl-tech.com\/Polymer_Modulator\/pm100.htm\">Polymer modulator<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/geology-mineralogy-and-gemology\/\">Applications in geology, mineralogy and gemology<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/raman-sem-combined-microscopy\/\">Raman-SEM combined microscopy<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/imaging-viru-a-bunek-2\/\">Nano-FTIR microscopy and imaging of cells and viruses<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/non-contact-and-non-destructive-analysis-of-art-objects-and-cultural-heritage\/\">Non-contact and non-destructive analysis of art objects and cultural heritage<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/study-of-cultural-heritage\/\">Cultural heritage analysis and restoration studies<\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Modular system<\/strong> of the <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.neaspec.com\/products\/neaspec-microscopes\/\">neaSCOPE microscopes<\/a><\/strong> opens up completely new horizons in the nanoworld:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/nano-imaging-of-nucleocyte-nucleus\/\">Nano-imaging of nucleocyte nucleus<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/molecular-staggering-in-collagen-fibers\/\">Molecular staggering in collagen fibers<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/analysis-of-secondary-structure-of-amyloid-fibers\/\">Analysis of secondary structure of amyloid fibers<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/ultrafast-electron-microscopy-in-nanowires\/\">Ultrafast electron microscopy in nanowires<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/local-conductivity-mapping-in-semiconductor-components\/\">Local conductivity mapping in semiconductor components<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/identification-of-materials-in-semiconductor-components\/\">Identification of materials in semiconductor components<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/characterization-of-surface-optical-waves\/\">Characterization of surface optical waves<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/observation-of-slow-light-in-natural-hyperbolic-materials\/\">Observation of slow light in natural hyperbolic materials<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/neasnom-and-graphene-plasmonics\/\">NeaSNOM and graphene plasmonics<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/analysis-of-optical-nano-antennas\/\">Analysis of optical nano-antennas<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/nanoscale-phase-transitions\/\">Nanoscale phase transitions<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/analysis-of-super-lenses-and-metamaterials\/\">Analysis of super lenses and metamaterials<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/mapping-the-heterogeneity-of-charge-carriers-in-nanocrystals\/\">Mapping the heterogeneity of charge carriers in nanocrystals<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/monitoring-of-the-corrosion-of-copper-surfaces-and-study-of-octadecanethiol-corrosion-inhibitor\/\">Monitoring of the corrosion of copper surfaces and study of octadecanethiol corrosion inhibitor<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/insulation-metal-transition-mapping-in-vanadium-dioxide\/\">Insulation-metal transition mapping in vanadium dioxide<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/direct-monitoring-of-lithium-decrease-in-the-li-ion-